| role. | native element before any role attribute. |
| state. | aria-expanded, aria-pressed, aria-invalid, disabled. |
| keyboard. | Tab reaches it; Enter/Space/Escape work. |
| focus. | moves into dialogs, returns to the trigger on close. |

